<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Prueba de balanceo</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #101827; color: #e8eefc; font: 16px system-ui, sans-serif; }
      main { max-width: 560px; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 20px; background: #1f2a44; box-shadow: 0 20px 55px #0008; text-align: center; }
      code { display: block; margin: 1rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: #101827; border-radius: 10px; color: #7dd3fc; font-size: 1.05rem; word-break: break-all; }
      button { border: 0; padding: .8rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 9px; background: #38bdf8; color: #06243a; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p>Respuesta servida por la réplica</p>
      <h1>__INSTANCE__</h1>
      <code>ID del contenedor: __CONTAINER_ID__</code>
      <p>Recarga para observar cómo Nginx alterna entre las dos réplicas.</p>
      <button onclick="location.reload()">Recargar</button>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
